<title>THAILAND: China buys 14,000 tonnes of Thai raw sugar -trade.</title>
<headline>China buys 14,000 tonnes of Thai raw sugar -trade.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>China entered the market and bought a 14,000-tonne cargo of Thai sugar for nearby shipment, trade sources said on Monday.</p>
</text>
